 "_about": "Layer 2 (product line) and layer 3 (series) of Cisco UCS, 14 Sep 2026. Lines are Cisco's server families. A part whose SKU names a MODEL (C240, B200, X210c, 6454) sits in that model's series; a part whose SKU names only the FAMILY prefix (UCSC-, UCSB-, UCSX-, UCSXE-, CSP-) sits in '<line> shared parts' (the reviewer's shared-parts rule); a generic UCS- component that fits several families sits in the 'UCS Server Components' line by component type. Order is load-bearing: bundles and fabric interconnects first (their SKUs carry server model tokens), model series before family shared parts.",
